! COMMON_NATIVE_GRID_VOLT_VAR_CONTROL_V1
! FROZEN 2026-08-22 FOR JANUARY-2025 POST-HOC VALIDATION ONLY.
! Not eligible for an independent-January holdout claim.
! Common physical-plant overlay for every B0-B7 arm.
! Existing IEEE 123-node capacitor locations and kvar ratings are unchanged.
! 120-V control basis, symmetric 114.6/125.4-V protection deadband,
! corresponding to a 0.955/1.045-pu operational guard inside the unchanged
! 0.95/1.05-pu hard acceptance envelope.  30-s action delay,
! and 1800-s dead time. No further January-informed tuning is permitted after
! this freeze. An unseen period is required for an independent evaluation.

New CapControl.PFR_NATIVE_C83 Capacitor=C83 Element=Line.L84 Terminal=2 Type=Voltage
~ PTRatio=20 ONSetting=114.6 OFFSetting=125.4
~ Delay=30 DelayOff=30 DeadTime=1800

